lede:
Blasts rock town in Syria's Aleppo






                Syria's state television Al-Ikhbariya reported powerful explosions early on Monday in Aleppo.&nbsp;

The cause of the blasts, which occured in the town of al-Eis, is currently under investigation.

A dozen vessels transit Hormuz Strait over the weekend






                A total of 12 vessels transited the Strait of Hormuz on Saturday and Sunday, shipping date showed on Monday.&nbsp;

The figure is down from&nbsp;35 during the previous weekend.&nbsp;
